/target
.env
# Cargo.lock is committed. This crate ships a binary, and `cargo build` without a lockfile
# resolves against whatever the registry index says today -- so "the same commit" is not the
# same program, and a CI green light can arrive from a dependency nobody reviewed. Library
# consumers ignore this file; only the binary's reproducibility depends on it.
# Project memory: this repo is public, and AGENTS.md records local environment
# facts and open threads. Loaded from disk by the agent either way.
AGENTS.md
